================================================================
1. PURPOSE AND SCOPE
================================================================

This License establishes the terms governing the
proprietary HSAAI software platform.

HSAAI is an independently developed Enterprise AI
Platform designed to support private, sovereign,
and self-hosted artificial intelligence workloads.

The platform architecture encompasses technologies
and capabilities including:

- Enterprise Artificial Intelligence
- Retrieval-Augmented Generation (Enterprise RAG)
- Local Large Language Models
- Arabic Enterprise AI
- AI Agents
- Multi-Agent Systems
- Enterprise Knowledge Management
- Knowledge Graphs
- Workflow Automation
- AI Governance
- LLMOps and MLOps
- DevSecOps
- Observability
- Kubernetes-oriented Deployment

These descriptions identify the technical scope of
the project and do not constitute a representation
that every capability is available or production-ready
in every deployment configuration.

This License applies only to software and materials
for which the Copyright Holder possesses the
necessary licensing rights.

